      "title": "Accenture beats Q4 revenue guidance, projects 3-6% growth for FY27",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/accenture-beats-q4-revenue-guidance-projects-3-6-growth-for-fy27-126100101493_1.html",
